OL,3,GNEWSAChristmas tree to be lit for 80th
OL,4,Aconsecutive year
OL,5,
OL,6,FLights switch-on event organiser Tom
OL,7,FHolman said: "So much has changed in
OL,8,Fthat time, but we think it's really
OL,9,Fnice that the tree is a reminder of
OL,10,Fwhat stayed the same."
